# model-guestbook

The first context the model keeps: the guestbook, one shared context with plain awareness.

- [x] shapes/guestbook.yml: context shared, a month's view, a role; takes a name and a hello
- [x] every turn kept in full with its address (production/guestbook#n) and what reproduces it (shape, input, effort, model hash, seed)
- [x] the model reads a view: recent turns plus a roster that says outright who is new and what to call them (Jamie 3)
- [x] fcpm model contexts; ask -Name -From; tried in a scratch folder (FCPM_CONTEXTS), the real guestbook untouched
- [ ] digitization: the member hello arrives as a bottle and becomes one ask (-Name, -From = the signer's pseudonym)
- [ ] the directory on qr.local lists shapes and public contexts by address
- [ ] thread contexts (one per conversation), and citing a turn by its address
